{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25790","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 入淮至盱眙 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 入淮至盱眙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山凝翠黛孤峰迥，淮起银花五两高。\n天外绮霞迷海鹤，日边红树艳仙桃。\n岸惊目眩同奔马，浦溢心疑覩拚鳌。\n寄谢云帆疾飞鸟，莫夸回雁卷轻毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}